<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LogSTOP: Temporal Scores over Prediction Sequences for Matching and Retrieval</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Avishree Khare
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
