<div id="A6.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p7.1" class="ltx_p">The prompts for LVLMs for query matching on QMTP-video are as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="A6.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A6.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Eventually p1: "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> present in any frame of this video?"</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Always p1: "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all frames of this video?"</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">p1 Until p2: "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p2}</annotation></semantics></math> present in any frame of this video and <math id="A6.I3.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all previous frames?"</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Always p1 and Eventually p2: "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all frames of this video and is a <math id="A6.I3.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p2}</annotation></semantics></math> present in any frame of this video?"</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Always p1 or Eventually p2: "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all frames of this video or is a <math id="A6.I3.i5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p2}</annotation></semantics></math> present in any frame of this video?"</p>
