<p id="A6.I3.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">p1 Until (Not p2): "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p2}</annotation></semantics></math> absent in any frame of this video and <math id="A6.I3.i7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all previous frames?"</p>
