<div id="A6.I3.i8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Always (p1 and p2): "Are both <math id="A6.I3.i8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A6.I3.i8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p2}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all frames of this video?"</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A6.I3.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">9.</span> 
<div id="A6.I3.i9.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.I3.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">(p1 and p2) Until p3: "Is a <math id="A6.I3.i9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p3}</annotation></semantics></math> present in any frame of this video and both <math id="A6.I3.i9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A6.I3.i9.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{p2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{p2}</annotation></semantics></math> present in all previous frames?"</p>
</div></li>
